  'Currículo de Informática de OSSU',
  'Programación',
  'Ruta completa de ciencia de la computación de la Open Source Society University (OSSU), leída en 2026-07-13 del commit 33d44a44e3526ede8e862bf1ad50ae5ae7a2f112. El MIT cubre el texto del repositorio (la lista y su orden). Los cursos enlazados son de sus anfitriones (MIT OpenCourseWare, Open Learning Library, Harvard, Coursera, edX…) con licencias propias, a menudo no comerciales: el OS enlaza, nunca copia ni redistribuye su material.',
  $json$[
    {"title":"Intro CS","body":"Temas: \"computation\", \"imperative programming\", \"basic data structures and algorithms\", \"and more\".\n- \"Introduction to Computer Science and Programming using Python\" · 14 weeks · 6-10 hours/week","resources":[{"label":"Introduction to Computer Science and Programming using Python","url":"https://github.com/ossu/computer-science/blob/main/coursepages/intro-cs/README.md","kind":"curso"}]},
    {"title":"Core programming","body":"Temas: \"functional programming\", \"design for testing\", \"program requirements\", \"common design patterns\", \"unit testing\", \"object-oriented design\", \"static typing\", \"dynamic typing\", \"ML-family languages (via Standard ML)\", \"Lisp-family languages (via Racket)\", \"Ruby\", \"and more\".\n- \"Systematic Program Design\" · 13 weeks · 8-10 hours/week\n- \"Class-based Program Design\" · 13 weeks · 5-10 hours/week\n- \"Programming Languages\" · 11 weeks · 4-8 hours/week\n- \"Object-Oriented Design\" · 13 weeks · 5-10 hours/week\n- \"Software Architecture\" · 4 weeks · 2-5 hours/week","resources":[{"label":"Systematic Program Design","url":"https://github.com/ossu/computer-science/blob/main/coursepages/spd/README.md","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Class-based Program Design","url":"https://github.com/ossu/computer-science/blob/main/coursepages/class-based/README.md","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Programming Languages","url":"https://courses.cs.washington.edu/courses/cse341/19sp/#lectures","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Object-Oriented Design","url":"https://course.ccs.neu.edu/cs3500f19/","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Software Architecture","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/software-architecture","kind":"curso"}]},
    {"title":"Core math","body":"Temas: \"discrete mathematics\", \"mathematical proofs\", \"basic statistics\", \"O-notation\", \"discrete probability\", \"and more\".\n- \"Calculus 1A: Differentiation\" · 13 weeks · 6-10 hours/week\n- \"Calculus 1B: Integration\" · 13 weeks · 5-10 hours/week\n- \"Calculus 1C: Coordinate Systems & Infinite Series\" · 6 weeks · 5-10 hours/week\n- \"Mathematics for Computer Science\" · 13 weeks · 5 hours/week","resources":[{"label":"Calculus 1A: Differentiation","url":"https://openlearninglibrary.mit.edu/courses/course-v1:MITx+18.01.1x+2T2019/about","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Calculus 1B: Integration","url":"https://openlearninglibrary.mit.edu/courses/course-v1:MITx+18.01.2x+3T2019/about","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Calculus 1C: Coordinate Systems & Infinite Series","url":"https://openlearninglibrary.mit.edu/courses/course-v1:MITx+18.01.3x+1T2020/about","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Mathematics for Computer Science","url":"https://openlearninglibrary.mit.edu/courses/course-v1:OCW+6.042J+2T2019/about","kind":"curso"}]},
    {"title":"CS Tools","body":"Temas: \"terminals and shell scripting\", \"vim\", \"command line environments\", \"version control\", \"and more\".\n- \"The Missing Semester of Your CS Education\" · 2 weeks · 12 hours/week","resources":[{"label":"The Missing Semester of Your CS Education","url":"https://missing.csail.mit.edu/","kind":"curso"}]},
    {"title":"Core systems","body":"Temas: \"procedural programming\", \"manual memory management\", \"boolean algebra\", \"gate logic\", \"memory\", \"computer architecture\", \"assembly\", \"machine language\", \"virtual machines\", \"high-level languages\", \"compilers\", \"operating systems\", \"network protocols\", \"and more\".\n- \"Build a Modern Computer from First Principles: From Nand to Tetris\" · 6 weeks · 7-13 hours/week\n- \"Build a Modern Computer from First Principles: Nand to Tetris Part II\" · 6 weeks · 12-18 hours/week\n- \"Operating Systems: Three Easy Pieces\" · 10-12 weeks · 6-10 hours/week\n- \"Computer Networking: a Top-Down Approach\" · 8 weeks · 4–12 hours/week","resources":[{"label":"Build a Modern Computer from First Principles: From Nand to Tetris","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/build-a-computer","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Build a Modern Computer from First Principles: Nand to Tetris Part II","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/nand2tetris2","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Operating Systems: Three Easy Pieces","url":"https://github.com/ossu/computer-science/blob/main/coursepages/ostep/README.md","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Computer Networking: a Top-Down Approach","url":"https://gaia.cs.umass.edu/kurose_ross/online_lectures.htm","kind":"curso"}]},
    {"title":"Core theory","body":"Temas: \"divide and conquer\", \"sorting and searching\", \"randomized algorithms\", \"graph search\", \"shortest paths\", \"data structures\", \"greedy algorithms\", \"minimum spanning trees\", \"dynamic programming\", \"NP-completeness\", \"and more\".\n- \"Algorithms: Design and Analysis, Part 1\" · 8 weeks · 4-8 hours/week\n- \"Algorithms: Design and Analysis, Part 2\" · 8 weeks · 4-8 hours/week","resources":[{"label":"Algorithms: Design and Analysis, Part 1","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/algorithms/stanford-university-algorithms-design-and-analysis-part-1","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Algorithms: Design and Analysis, Part 2","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/algorithms/stanford-university-algorithms-design-and-analysis-part-2","kind":"curso"}]},
    {"title":"Core security","body":"Temas: \"Confidentiality, Integrity, Availability\", \"Secure Design\", \"Defensive Programming\", \"Threats and Attacks\", \"Network Security\", \"Cryptography\", \"and more\".\n- \"Cybersecurity Fundamentals\" · 8 weeks · 10-12 hours/week\n- \"Principles of Secure Coding\" · 4 weeks · 4 hours/week\n- \"Identifying Security Vulnerabilities\" · 4 weeks · 4 hours/week\n- \"Identifying Security Vulnerabilities in C/C++ Programming\" · 4 weeks · 5 hours/week\n- \"Exploiting and Securing Vulnerabilities in Java Applications\" · 4 weeks · 5 hours/week","resources":[{"label":"Cybersecurity Fundamentals","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/cybersecurity/rochester-institute-of-technology-cybersecurity-fundamentals","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Principles of Secure Coding","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/secure-coding-principles","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Identifying Security Vulnerabilities","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/identifying-security-vulnerabilities","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Identifying Security Vulnerabilities in C/C++ Programming","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/identifying-security-vulnerabilities-c-programming","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Exploiting and Securing Vulnerabilities in Java Applications","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/exploiting-securing-vulnerabilities-java-applications","kind":"curso"}]},
    {"title":"Core applications","body":"Temas: \"Agile methodology\", \"REST\", \"software specifications\", \"refactoring\", \"relational databases\", \"transaction processing\", \"data modeling\", \"neural networks\", \"supervised learning\", \"unsupervised learning\", \"OpenGL\", \"ray tracing\", \"and more\".\n- \"Databases: Modeling and Theory\" · 2 weeks · 10 hours/week\n- \"Databases: Relational Databases and SQL\" · 2 weeks · 10 hours/week\n- \"Databases: Semistructured Data\" · 2 weeks · 10 hours/week\n- \"Machine Learning\" · 11 weeks · 9 hours/week\n- \"Computer Graphics\" · 6 weeks · 12 hours/week\n- \"Software Engineering: Introduction\" · 6 weeks · 8-10 hours/week","resources":[{"label":"Databases: Modeling and Theory","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/databases/stanford-university-databases-modeling-and-theory","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Databases: Relational Databases and SQL","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/relational-databases/stanford-university-databases-relational-databases-and-sql","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Databases: Semistructured Data","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/relational-databases/stanford-university-databases-semistructured-data","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Machine Learning","url":"https://www.deeplearning.ai/courses/machine-learning-specialization/","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Computer Graphics","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/computer-graphics/the-university-of-california-san-diego-computer-graphics","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Software Engineering: Introduction","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/software-engineering/university-of-british-columbia-software-engineering-introduction","kind":"curso"}]},
    {"title":"Core ethics","body":"Temas: \"Social Context\", \"Analytical Tools\", \"Professional Ethics\", \"Intellectual Property\", \"Privacy and Civil Liberties\", \"and more\".\n- \"Ethics, Technology and Engineering\" · 9 weeks · 2 hours/week\n- \"Introduction to Intellectual Property\" · 4 weeks · 2 hours/week\n- \"Data Privacy Fundamentals\" · 3 weeks · 3 hours/week","resources":[{"label":"Ethics, Technology and Engineering","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/ethics/icarus-yale-ethics-technology-and-engineering","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Introduction to Intellectual Property","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/intellectual-property","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Data Privacy Fundamentals","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/data-privacy-fundamentals","kind":"curso"}]},
    {"title":"Advanced CS","body":"Temas: \"Software Engineering\", \"Security\", \"Operating Systems\", \"Distributed Systems\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Computer Vision\", \"Natural Language Processing\", \"and more\".\n- \"Software Engineering\" · 6 weeks · 8-10 hours/week\n- \"Security\" · 4 weeks · 5 hours/week\n- \"Distributed Systems\" · 10 weeks · 6-8 hours/week\n- \"Computer Vision\" · 6 weeks · 12 hours/week\n- \"Natural Language Processing\" · 6 weeks · 12 hours/week","resources":[{"label":"Software Engineering","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/software-engineering/indiana-university-software-engineering","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Security","url":"https://www.coursera.org/learn/ cybersecurity","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Distributed Systems","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/computer-science/ethiopian-university-distributed-systems","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Computer Vision","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/computer-vision/the-university-of-edinburgh-computer-vision","kind":"curso"},{"label":"Natural Language Processing","url":"https://www.edx.org/learn/natural-language-processing/stanford-university-natural-language-processing","kind":"curso"}]},
